```c
#ifndef __WIN32
#include <grp.h>
#include <pwd.h>
#include <sys/types.h>
#include <unistd.h>
#endif

#include <Rcpp.h>
```

Simply put, I have moved the `Rcpp.h` include _after_ all others. Originally, it appeared on the fist line of the file. This change is sufficient to make the compilation succeed.

